    <string name="widget_quantas">How many coins besides Bitcoin</string>
    <string name="widget_mostrar_faixa">Show today\'s high and low</string>
    <string name="widget_mostrar_volume">Show traded volume</string>
    <string name="widget_ajuda">The widget uses the same exchange and currency chosen here. Ask and Bid come from the exchange order book — with the market average that column is hidden, because an average has no book. If it looks cramped on the home screen, long-press it and drag the edges.</string>
